' F17 -- Built versus delivered.
' Chapter 6 (Evaluation). Concept diagram.
' Claim supported: what a student can reach is decided by 13 backend flags, all
' default False, of which production switches on four. Since 2026-10-29/30 each
' UI flag is derived from its backend flag, which removed the August half-states;
' two gaps remain where a flag does not say what it seems to.
' Pinned at 2b8b1f7b. Sources: backend/core/config.py:106-219 (flags),
' docker-compose.prod.yml:142-153 (derived VITE flags), src/App.tsx:384-395
' (ClassicTool), src/App.tsx:197-212 (StudentV4Redirect), backend/main.py:258
' (search router), backend/services/v4_spaces_service.py:865-896 (Home ask),
' backend/services/review/mastery.py:28-31 (cascade).
@startuml f17-flag-reality
!include _style.iuml

title Built versus delivered — 13 flags, 4 on in production

skinparam rectangle {
  BackgroundColor #FFFFFF
  FontSize 10
}

rectangle "**ON in production** since 2026-10-29/30" as ON #BFBFBF {
  rectangle "FEATURE_V4\nSpaces, Library, Home ask" as V4
  rectangle "FEATURE_V4_READER\nreader: Explain, Ask, practice" as RD
  rectangle "FEATURE_LUNA_SESSIONS\nLuna study sessions" as LS
  rectangle "FEATURE_STUDENT_UPLOADS\nLibrary uploads" as SU
  V4 -[hidden]right- RD
  LS -[hidden]right- SU
  V4 -[hidden]down- LS
}

rectangle "**OFF** — code default" as OFF #F2F2F2 {
  rectangle "REVIEW_ENGINE · EXAM_MODE\nSTUDY_GUIDE · GLOBAL_SEARCH\nASK_LUNA\n//classic tools, no v4 room yet//" as OFF1
  rectangle "COURSE_BRAIN · STUDIO_PAGES\nLANDING_PEOPLE\nLLM_PROMPT_LOGGING\n//backend only//" as OFF2
}

rectangle "**How a flag reaches the screen**" as HOW #FFFFFF {
  rectangle "**One switch per feature**\nthe prod build copies each backend flag\ninto its VITE_FEATURE_* build argument\n(8 of the 13 have a UI side)" as SW
  rectangle "**Classic rooms**\na student is redirected to the v4 room\nthat replaced it; a classic tool whose\nbackend is off answers 404" as GATE
  SW -[hidden]right- GATE
}

rectangle "**Gaps that remain**" as GAPS #FFFFFF {
  rectangle "**Flag no longer gates the capability**\nGLOBAL_SEARCH off hides the classic\ncommand palette, but the same course\ntutor answers on v4 Home under FEATURE_V4" as LEAK #DCDCDC
  rectangle "**Silent cascade**\nCOURSE_BRAIN off -> no concepts written\n-> review_cards.concept_id stays NULL\n-> the mastery update returns early" as CASC #DCDCDC
  LEAK -[hidden]right- CASC
}

LS -[hidden]down- OFF1
OFF1 -[hidden]right- OFF2
OFF1 -[hidden]down- SW
SW -[hidden]down- LEAK

legend bottom
  At 0be0081 (2026-08-18): 7 flags, all off; three screens or buttons rendered while their
  backend was off, so their requests returned 404. Fixed by 6c95041b (10-29) and 28c81ca3 (10-30).
  Shading: dark = on in production · light = built but off · mid = a gap that remains.
endlegend

@enduml
